    {
      "id": "t_2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753315200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "QUICKSILVER v1 (2020)\n\nEvery server: its own LMDB —\nmmap'd B+tree, single-writer\nMVCC. Root -> intermediate ->\nleaf, hash-chained log, fsynced.\nFull copy on every single box.\nDNS change reaches 90% of the\nfleet in seconds.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "QUICKSILVER v1 (2020)\n\nEvery server: its own LMDB —\nmmap'd B+tree, single-writer\nMVCC. Root -> intermediate ->\nleaf, hash-chained log, fsynced.\nFull copy on every single box.\nDNS change reaches 90% of the\nfleet in seconds.",
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
