    },
    {
      "id": "t_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 505,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753315200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT BROKE — DEC 16, 2021, 20:10-20:40 UTC\nA cron job piped dos-make-addr-conf into dosctl without `set -o pipefail`. The first command failed; its exit code was\nsilently swallowed by the pipe, and empty output got written as the value of a Quicksilver key the fleet-wide\nDDoS-detection daemon (dosd) depends on. The same instant, global fan-out that makes Quicksilver fast pushed that empty\nconfig everywhere within seconds. dosd choked fleet-wide; requests queued up to 5 seconds for 30 minutes.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHAT BROKE — DEC 16, 2021, 20:10-20:40 UTC\nA cron job piped dos-make-addr-conf into dosctl without `set -o pipefail`. The first command failed; its exit code was\nsilently swallowed by the pipe, and empty output got written as the value of a Quicksilver key the fleet-wide\nDDoS-detection daemon (dosd) depends on. The same instant, global fan-out that makes Quicksilver fast pushed that empty\nconfig everywhere within seconds. dosd choked fleet-wide; requests queued up to 5 seconds for 30 minutes.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "e_footnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753315200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fast, global replication and a fast, global blast radius are the same mechanism, pointed at different outcomes.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Fast, global replication and a fast, global blast radius are the same mechanism, pointed at different outcomes.",
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    }
  ],
